## 📦 Installation

```bash
pip install namgpt
```
## 🚀 Quick Start

```bash
namgpt --help
```

```bash
namgpt khoi-dong
```

```bash
namgpt chon
```
## ✨ Features

- Beautiful CLI
- Rich Panels
- Progress Bars
- Spinners
- Interactive Menus
- JSON Storage
- Calculator
- BMI Calculator
- Random Generator
